        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions GDP625005SBR, Guadalupe Bamboo Cabinet Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe realistic look of this Solid Brass Bamboo Cabinet Pull was achieved by molding the perfect piece of real bamboo. After perfecting the master molds, the craftsman at First Impressions cast each piece from Solid Brass. Each cabinet pull is hand finished in your choice of high-quality finishes. The Guadalupe Bamboo Cabinet Pull is 5-3/8 inches long.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-GSP03-specifications.gif?v=1704354642\" width=\"384\" height=256\" border=\"0\" alt=\"First Impressions GDP625005SBR Dimensions Diagram\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nFirst Impressions also offers <a href=\"/products/solid-brass-bamboo-door-pull-first-impressions-gdp625sbr\"><b>Bamboo Door Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the First Impressions GDP625005SBR Guadalupe Cabinet Handle:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 5-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 3-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2.13\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Clearance: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-GDP03-specifcations.pdf?v=1704262233\"><b>First Impressions GDP625005SBR Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNote: This door pull is hand assembled in the USA when you order it—allowing it to be custom designed to fit your specific door application, including <b>Other Lengths</b>. Unfortunately, because of the made-to-order nature of the door handle, it is <b>Not Returnable.</b> Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> with your requirements or if you have any questions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Solid Brass Bamboo Cabinet Pull",
                "description": "The realistic look of this Solid Brass Bamboo Cabinet Pull was achieved by molding the perfect piece of real bamboo. After perfecting the master molds, the craftsman at First Impressions cast each piece from Solid Brass. Each cabinet pull is hand finished in your choice of high-quality finishes. The Guadalupe Bamboo Cabinet Pull is 5-3/8 inches long.\r\n",
